{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"agent_message","text":"The rendering, synthesized audio, and flight systems are in place. Combat uses swept Rapier collision queries, and rescue requires lining up with a beacon and holding the tractor beam. Next I’m connecting the five missions, chart, and menus so the full campaign can be played from launch to debrief.\n"}}
